Z||000007||Fierokid87||08-23-2001||12:13 PM||||I would like to see this power stearing.  All though id have to agree with falconhulk<BR>why would you want power stearing.  I think it does take away from the expereance of driving the Fiero<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLOODY"> Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fieroguy1987<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
